OL,3,ASeven students killed and nearly 100
OL,4,Ainjured in explosion in Afghanistan,
OL,5,Aofficial says
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least seven students have been
OL,8,Fkilled and 99 others have been injured
OL,9,Ffollowing an explosion near a school in
OL,10,FAfghanistan, an official has said.
OL,12,FThe incident happened on Saturday
OL,13,Fmorning in the Anderseir area of
OL,14,FAsadabad, the capital of Kunar
OL,15,Fprovince, a spokesperson for the
OL,16,FTaliban government's interior ministry
OL,17,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
